        //       RE-ENGINEERED  na

        // PURPOSE OF THIS FUNCTION:
        // This function provides the Vapor Density in air as a
        // function of dry bulb temperature, and Relative Humidity.

        // METHODOLOGY EMPLOYED:
        // ideal gas law
        // Universal gas const for water vapor 461.52 J/(kg K)

        // REFERENCES:
